lease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nThere are 30 houses in the community. Mr. Li tells Mr. Zhang that he thinks most of the houses are newly renovated, some are under renovation, and very few are not renovated at all. After investigating, Mr. Zhang finds that 5 houses are under renovation.\n\n[Question]\nHow many houses does Mr. Zhang estimate are newly renovated after his investigation?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. After his investigation, Mr. Zhang estimates that 10 houses are newly renovated.\nB. After his investigation, Mr. Zhang estimates that 25 houses are newly renovated.\nC. After his investigation, Mr. Zhang estimates that 24 houses are newly renovated.\nD. After his investigation, Mr. Zhang estimates that 15 houses are newly renovated.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.012431217146663105,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52ab7c2ddb05a7fe2ebe9","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452151321,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:55:51","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"c32fb1fc36364f3e8958cc843adaac33"}